{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/1_ATD.png?t=1741185326\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Demo features the very first chapter of <i>Joke Too Real</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/2.png?t=1741185326\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Joke Too Real</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/3_EN.png?t=1741185326\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first chapter of <i>Joke Too Real</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557660?t=1741185326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/342334ae3000a7b445f15fa4f0fb904783167098/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741185326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/7c0827af26aed09c6d33fbaab71d5597840752b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741185326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/7c0827af26aed09c6d33fbaab71d5597840752b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741185326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Joke Too Real is a noir-style detective game that contains depictions of crime, corpses murder investigations, and suicide. There are scenes of violence, including character deaths and the presence of blood and corpses. Strong language is used throughout the dialogue.\r\nThe game also includes mature themes such as bribery, corruption, and moral ambiguity that may not be suitable for all audiences. There are mild sexual references, though no nudity or explicit sexual content. Certain NPCs discuss past experiences of sexual harassment."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/1_ATD.png?t=1741185326\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Demo features the very first chapter of <i>Joke Too Real</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/2.png?t=1741185326\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Joke Too Real</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/3_EN.png?t=1741185326\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first chapter of <i>Joke Too Real</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Slater Chae"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3523520","name":"Joke Too Real"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/fd040f0ffb2e9052c9bd6e19b18f3c632167ba45/header.jpg?t=1741185326","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107784,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie480.mp4?t=1741065930","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie_max.mp4?t=1741065930"},"name":"Short Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107784/67d9600ad41e2af2af9648b21f5f99187ae4c3b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741065930","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741065930","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741065930"}}],"name":"Joke Too Real 